;    0: TWdLink(count=1416, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Well, how 'bout that, y'all can get up on the roof at this school! That's a rare one!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A warm breeze flowing across the roof.</STYLE><PG>
"Um, reckon I can call you <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Just Natsumi's fine."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"All right then, <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
Back at morning homeroom, what were you fixin' to ask me?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? Um, well..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Now that I've calmed down, something like "Are </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> the reincarnation of </STYLE>Itohime<STYLE ID="1">?" is really hard to say.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But </STYLE>Goshirakawa-san<STYLE ID="1"> really does look a lot like </STYLE>Itohime<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
"Say, don't tell me I look like somebody?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ooh, now that's a big reaction! Hit the nail right on the head, didn't I?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Yeah, I guess so... Only, </STYLE>she<STYLE ID="2">'s already passed away..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hmm, is that right..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Then </STYLE>Goshirakawa-san<STYLE ID="1"> turned her eyes to the sky.</STYLE><PG>
"I'm the type that puts a good bit of stock in fortune-tellin' and such. 
{PAUSE ""}
Could be I came here 'cause you were thinkin' about her, <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Goshirakawa-san<STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="3" RUBY="いおり">Iori</STYLE>'s fine, I'm tellin' you!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Okay. </STYLE>Iori<STYLE ID="2">, then. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Iori<STYLE ID="2">, doesn't it bother you to be seen that way?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Just because you look like someone..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hmm, can't say it bothers me none. 
{PAUSE ""}
If anything, I'd sure like to know more about her. 
{PAUSE ""}
What was she like?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"We didn't meet all that much, but she really longed for Motoki-cho. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">We promised to go to Motoki-cho together, but in the end it never </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="かな">came true</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">She said that if she were ever reborn, she'd want to come to Motoki-cho."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\フィオ\フィオ腰に手バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Well, I'll be! Then maybe I really am her reincarnation!
{PAUSE ""}
　Ahahaha!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Iori<STYLE ID="1"> laughed brightly, without seeming to mind at all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But right away, she looked down at the schoolyard, eyes lowered.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\フィオ\フィオバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Then I sure do owe her one. 
{PAUSE ""}
Otherwise you wouldn't have given my gag a comeback, <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>, and I'd have just gone on bein' the odd one out in class."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\フィオ\フィオ腰に手バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"Aha! Sorry, sorry, I'm talkin' your ear off!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, it's just... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">It only just happened, so I'm still a little confused..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah, I reckon..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Her eyes already downcast, </STYLE>Iori<STYLE ID="1"> lowered them even further, her face turning serious.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Then, as if using that for momentum, she looked straight up.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\フィオ\フィオバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Well then, I'll be her reincarnation. Suits me just fine."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But that really wouldn't be right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Truth is... 
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "1000" "PASS"}
I have no memory."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No foolin', I truly don't remember a thing from before April 8 last week. 
{PAUSE ""}
I don't know why I came to Motoki-cho or how I'd been gettin' along..."<PG>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\宝石と想いを胸に_　ピアノ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"I just remember my name, is all. 
{PAUSE ""}
The police and other folks are lookin' into who I am and where and how I lived. 
{PAUSE ""}
Right now I'm stayin' at a care facility here in Motoki-cho, though... 
{PAUSE ""}
Mopin' around forever just ain't me, so I pestered 'em till they let me into high school. 
{PAUSE ""}
So... 
{PAUSE ""}
so it's all right by me if I'm her stand-in. 
{PAUSE ""}
Right now, I'm nobody anyhow."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE><PG>
"Ahaha! Shoot, that got kinda dark, didn't it!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"N-no, thank you for telling me."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE追加\pingpongpangpong.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">―</STYLE>Iori Goshirakawa<STYLE ID="1">-san of class 2-2, please come to the staff room at once.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\フィオ\フィオ腰に手バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Oh, they're callin' me in! A transfer student's busy as all get-out. 
{PAUSE ""}
Bye now!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Iori<STYLE ID="1"> took off running and left the roof just like that.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I took a breath and looked up at the sky.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The girl with no memory, </STYLE>Iori Goshirakawa<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She<STYLE ID="1"> may or may not be </STYLE>Itohime<STYLE ID="1">'s reincarnation. There's no way to know for sure.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But there's one thing I can say.</STYLE><PG>
Iori<STYLE ID="1"> says she's fine being </STYLE>Itohime<STYLE ID="1">'s reincarnation. If so―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I want </STYLE>Iori<STYLE ID="1"> to come to love this place.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If she has no memories, I want her to fill up on wonderful ones.</STYLE><PG>
Itohime<STYLE ID="1"> said it:</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
'<STYLE ID="2">I</STYLE> can make the people around me happy<STYLE ID="1">.'</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So I'll believe that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Believing that, I'll live here with </STYLE>Iori<STYLE ID="1"> and everyone.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">For now, simply looking ahead.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Itohime<STYLE ID="1"> is the past, and I won't let my thoughts </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="は">race</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> only there.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Iori<STYLE ID="1"> is the future, and I let my dreams </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="は">race</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> toward it.</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
